    "updated_at": "2026-11-07T22:11:11Z",
    "body": "Local commit 3780215 on issue/117-cross-drill-part-check (not pushed yet). The cross arm now sweeps the finished chain through the part solid and refuses by name: the hole, how deep the tip got, and whether the model has no hole there or the drill runs past its floor. Pinned by drilling_cross_part (3 tests). The cross-drill fixtures now model their holes; the lathe axis-reader problem this exposed is filed as #152. All cross-drill suites plus drill_prior*, drill_reach_fit, lathe_post, lathe_spindle_*, posting and operations pass, and clippy -p camcraft-app is clean.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
